mainmenu "Panel button read"

config PANEL_BTN_SECONDS
	int "How long to watch the buttons (seconds)"
	default 20
	help
	  The window a person at the bench has to press every button.  It is also the whole
	  of this sample's statistical power: with a 10 ms poll, 20 s is about 2,000 chances
	  to see a 1.  Nothing shorter is worth running with a human in the loop.

source "Kconfig.zephyr"
